## 1. SESSION & TOPOLOGY

| Feature                                               | Status | Notes                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| 2–4 players can join same session (local host)        | true   | Tested with 3 players using ParrelSync clones                         |
| Relay / DA options visible in UI                      | true   | DAHOST / DACLIENT buttons present but not used for this assignment    |
| Distributed Authority topology selectable             | false  | Architecture is DA-friendly but DA is not implemented                 |
| Session starter becomes temporary Keeper              | true   | Initial Keeper = lowest active clientId / host fallback               |
