## 3. TURN / ROUND / YEAR SYNCHRONIZATION

| Feature                                               | Status | Notes                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Shared turn counter synchronized                      | true   | `globalTurn` the same on all clients                                  |
| Shared year counter synchronized                      | true   | `roundIndex` increments after every 4 global turns                    |
| Only one action per turn enforced (lockstep)          | true   | `_actedThisTurn` prevents double actions                              |
| Year increments after 4 global turns                  | true   | `TurnsPerYear = 4`                                                     |
| Inactive players default to Skip Turn                 | true   | Inactive players are ignored by lockstep checks                       |
| Mid-session joiners inactive until year-end           | true   | Late joiners do not interfere with current year’s lockstep            |

**Summary:**  
Turn and year logic is globally consistent and prevents desync through strict lockstep.

