## 4. KEEPER LOGIC (deterministic + migratory)

| Feature                                               | Status | Notes                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| keeperTally initialized from lastResolvedRound        | true   | Implemented as `snapshot` / `lastResolvedRound` per `NetPlayerState`  |
| Deterministic Keeper selection at turn 1              | true   | Lowest active clientId (or host) is chosen if no prior state          |
| Host migration occurs at turn 1                       | true   | In the sense that Keeper “role” moves; no actual host migration       |
| keeperTally transferred old → new Keeper              | true   | Snapshots updated and copied every year-end                           |
| Keeper UI updates across all clients                  | true   | Scoreboard reflects current Keeper consistently                      |

**Summary:**  
Keeper role is deterministic, resilient to changes, and independent of actual host authority.

