## 5. TURN ACTIONS (End Turn / Skip Turn)

| Feature                                               | Status | Notes                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| End Turn increments score + sets exhaustion=true      | true   | `RegisterEndTurn` on server calls `AddToScoreServer` + `SetExhaustedServer(true)` |
| Skip Turn no score change + exhaustion=false          | true   | `RegisterSkipTurn` calls `SetExhaustedServer(false)` only             |
| All players locked into same turn state               | true   | Turn only advances when all active players have acted                 |

**Summary:**  
End/Skip Turn behavior matches the design and is enforced server-side.

