## 8. MID-SESSION JOIN (optional)

| Feature                                               | Status | Notes                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| New player joins and sees correct turn/year/Keeper    | true   | No reset of `globalTurn` or `roundIndex` on join                      |
| New player spawns as isActive=false                   | true   | Set inactive when `_gameStarted == true`                              |
| Inactive mid-joiners reactivated at year-end          | true   | `ReactivateInactivePlayersAtYearEnd()` sets them back to active       |
| New player has snapshot assigned                      | true   | `lastResolvedRound` copied to their state along with others           |

**Summary:**  
Mid-session joining is safe: late players don’t disrupt the current year, then join the rotation at the next year boundary.

